# Angular 22 — Portfolio

Stack: Angular 22 standalone app, SSR/prerender (`outputMode: server`), SCSS, `layers-ui`, Material tooltip only.

## Components & DI

- Prefer `inject()` over constructor injection.
- Do not set `standalone: true` (default).
- Prefer signals for local UI state (`signal`, `computed`); avoid `OnInit` when a resolver or constructor/`afterNextRender` is enough.
- Colocate `*.ts` / `*.html` / `*.scss` under `pages/` or feature folders.

## Routing & SEO

- Put page `title` on the route; apply meta/OG/JSON-LD in a `ResolveFn` so SSR/prerender emit tags in the initial HTML.
- Keep copy in `src/app/data/seo.json` + `me.json`. Use absolute URLs for `og:image` / canonical (via `siteUrl`).
- Prefer `NgOptimizedImage` with explicit `width`/`height`; mark LCP images `priority`.

## Styles

- Shared tokens/typography live in `src/styles/`; page layout overrides stay in the page SCSS.
- Use existing breakpoint mixins from `_breakpoints.scss`.
- Do not reintroduce dead hero utilities (meta rows, CTA buttons, intro-banner layout).

## Hygiene

- No unused services, utils, or Material modules.
- Keep changes scoped; do not expand scope into unplanned sections.
